{"book":"1-kings","model":"glm-5.1","timestamp":"2026-05-04T03:30:58.127503270Z","verse":26,"ref":"1-kings 3:26","tier":"glm-5.1","chapter":3,"translation":"Then ⟨the⟩ woman whose son ⟨was⟩ ⟨the⟩ living one spoke to ⟨the⟩ king — for her compassion grew hot over her son — and she said, 'Please, my lord, give her ⟨את⟩ the living child, and do not put him to death.' But ⟨the⟩ other ⟨woman⟩ was saying, 'Neither to me nor to you shall he be — cut ⟨him⟩!'","tokens":[{"surface":"ותאמר","gloss":"Then…spoke"},{"surface":"האשה","gloss":"the woman"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"whose"},{"surface":"בנה","gloss":"son"},{"surface":"החי","gloss":"was the living one"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"to"},{"surface":"המלך","gloss":"the king"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"נכמרו","gloss":"grew hot"},{"surface":"רחמיה","gloss":"her compassion"},{"surface":"על","gloss":"over"},{"surface":"בנה","gloss":"her son"},{"surface":"ותאמר","gloss":"and she said"},{"surface":"בי","gloss":"Please"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"my lord"},{"surface":"תנו","gloss":"give"},{"surface":"לה","gloss":"her"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the living child"},{"surface":"הילוד","gloss":"the child"},{"surface":"החי","gloss":"living"},{"surface":"והמת","gloss":"and"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"do not"},{"surface":"תמיתהו","gloss":"put him to death"},{"surface":"וזאת","gloss":"But the other"},{"surface":"אמרת","gloss":"was saying"},{"surface":"גם","gloss":"Neither"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"to me"},{"surface":"גם","gloss":"nor"},{"surface":"לך","gloss":"to you"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"יהיה","gloss":"shall he be"},{"surface":"גזרו","gloss":"cut ⟨him⟩!"}]}